#: ../../tools/nextstrain_tools.rst:32 59e6e643b1fc47ceb0e81dfe596fb329
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get metadata and phylogenetic summary for a Nextstrain "
"pathogen dataset. Returns title, last update date, number of sequences, "
"data provenance, maintainers, root node attributes, and available "
"coloring options. Useful for understanding the scope and currency of "
"pathogen genomic surveillance data. Example: 'zika' returns 1044 "
"sequences tracking Zika virus evolution, last updated Dec 2025."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nextstrain_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/nextstrain_tools.rst:65
