#: ../../tools/nextstrain_tools.rst:63 5a7b7b040545444da66113a9a5247c5a
msgid ""
"**Description**: List available pathogen phylogenetic datasets from "
"Nextstrain. Returns datasets grouped by pathogen (e.g., avian-flu, "
"dengue, ebola, flu, measles, mpox, SARS-CoV-2, zika). Optionally filter "
"by pathogen name. Nextstrain provides real-time molecular epidemiology "
"for public health, tracking how pathogens evolve and spread worldwide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nextstrain_tools.rst:67 8457e44419ba41cbb619c57cdd7ebf46
msgid ""
"``pathogen`` (string, null) (optional) Optional pathogen name filter. "
"Examples: 'flu', 'ebola', 'zika', 'dengue', 'mpox'. Leave empty for all "
"pathogens."
msgstr ""

